                            <comment id="15974444" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 19 Apr 2017 10:53:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue is caused by caching isLocal flag in DistributedJoinBatch. Since query context may change, this flag also should be changed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Removing the flag from the batch and adding a method instead which will check query context.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15974466" author="agoncharuk" created="Wed, 19 Apr 2017 11:23:18 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Merged the fix to 2.0&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
